# Supabase Configuration (Optional for Cloud Persistence & Live Realtime)
# JanUrja runs out-of-the-box in local high-speed persistence mode without keys!
# If you want to connect to a live Supabase project, execute supabase/schema.sql
# in your Supabase SQL editor and add your project URL and anon public key below:

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key-here
